{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a965658d18538df0","name":"Hijkata Training","source":{"id":"source:reference-a965658d18538df0","title":"Hijkata Training","revision":20880,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:42:13Z","sha256":"fc311c619f62a87b2427a77da5cafc1ba3641b9f137b6bdfbeedcc4a75b20d08","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20880","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Hijkata%20Training&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a965658d18538df0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained in the Hijkata style of unarmed fighting and can quickly turn enemies' attacks against them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Reflexes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Reflexes","referenceId":"reference:eefac0ff23eeb160"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Once per round, when an adjacent enemy successfully damages you with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},", you can make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," at a -5 penalty against that enemy, even if the enemy's attack normally would not provoke an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, when an enemy provokes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," from you and you successfully damage that enemy with an Unarmed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"},", that enemy takes a penalty to attack rolls equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," modifier (minimum +1, for a minimum penalty of -1) until the end of your next turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hijkata Expertise"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hijkata_Expertise"}]}," Talent, once per encounter, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," to designate a single adjacent ally. Until the start of your next turn, any enemy adjacent to you or the designated ally that makes an attack roll against that ally provokes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," from you. If the ally moves during his or her turn, you can immediately move a number of squares up to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},"; however, you must end your movement in a square that is adjacent to the designated ally.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
